                    <h1 class="display-6 mb-5">Our mission is to provide a platform for Tamils to connect, learn, and grow together.</h1>
                    <div class="bg-light border-bottom border-5 border-primary rounded p-4 mb-4">
                        <p class="text-dark mb-2">Whether you are a student, a professional, an entrepreneur, or a retiree, we have something to offer you.
