                        </p>
                        <!-- <span class="text-primary">Jhon Doe, Founder</span> -->
                    </div>
                    <p class="mb-5">We are a non-profit organization dedicated to promoting the interests of Tamil people living in Canada and fostering a sense of unity and belonging within the community.</p>
